/-- Textual carrier for `Euclidean Norm for Random Vectors`. -/
def rem_10_4_euclidean_norm : String :=
  "We measure distance in $\\mathbb{R}^d$ by the Euclidean norm and use the " ++
  "following notation:\n\\[\n\\lVert(x_1,x_2,\\ldots,x_d)\\rVert\n\\coloneqq\n" ++
  "\\sqrt{x_1^2+x_2^2+\\cdots+x_d^2}.\n\\]"
